American Academy of Orthopaedic Surgeons, OrthoInfo. Chronic Shoulder Instability and Dislocation. English.

[Authorized source](https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/chronic-shoulder-instability/).

Introduces instability, recurrent displacement, relevant structures, and assessment. Compare with the separate anatomical discussions of laxity, capsule, labrum, and muscle control.

